Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:01.90,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,第二部分，逐个 job 看\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}Part 2, job by job.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:02.22,0:00:05.68,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,先看构建 container：课上把它放在最前面\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}First, build container: the lecture builds it first,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:05.68,0:00:10.86,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,这样每个检查都在同一个环境里运行，构建的问题也能尽早暴露\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}so every check runs in the same environment, and build problems show up early.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:11.10,0:00:13.72,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,课上说的是一台远程 CI 服务器\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}The lecture speaks of one remote CI server.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:14.04,0:00:17.03,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,GitHub 给每个 job 一台新的\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}GitHub gives you a new one for every job:
Dialogue: 0,0:00:17.03,0:00:20.44,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,这个文件里六次写着 runs-on: ubuntu-latest\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}runs-on: ubuntu-latest, six times in this file.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:20.76,0:00:22.98,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,每个 job 都从一台空机器开始\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}Each job starts on an empty machine.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:23.27,0:00:26.23,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,README 里 build 这个 job 只构建一次 image\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}The README's build job builds the image once,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:26.23,0:00:27.94,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,用 commit ID 打 tag\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}tagged with the commit ID.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:28.26,0:00:32.15,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,它把 image 存成一个 tar 文件，作为 artifact 上传\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}It saves it as a tar file and uploads it as an artifact,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:32.15,0:00:35.28,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,这样其他每个 job 拿到的都是完全相同的 image\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}so every other job gets the exact same image.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:35.52,0:00:38.95,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,在 GitHub 上，点一个 job，再点一个步骤，就能打开它的日志\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}On GitHub, click a job, then a step, to open its log.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:39.27,0:00:41.99,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,Docker 用 Dockerfile 构建 image\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}Docker builds the image from the Dockerfile and names it cheese-app-api:<commit ID>.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:41.99,0:00:45.93,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,把它命名为 cheese-app-api，冒号，再加 commit ID\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}Docker builds the image from the Dockerfile and names it cheese-app-api:<commit ID>.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:46.25,0:00:49.17,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,这个 tag 只表示这个 commit 的 image，别的都不是\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}That tag means this commit's image, nothing else.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:49.42,0:00:52.80,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,有一个小疏漏：README 说有 Buildx 缓存\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}A small slip: the README promises Buildx caching,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:52.80,0:00:57.56,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,但构建用的是默认的构建器，也没有东西保存缓存\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}but the build runs on the default builder, and nothing saves a cache,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:57.56,0:01:00.66,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,所以每台全新的机器都从头重建\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}so every fresh machine rebuilds from scratch.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:00.98,0:01:02.62,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,练习里讲了怎么加\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}The exercises show how.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:02.87,0:01:08.37,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,用 docker save 把 image 打成一个文件，大约 176 MB\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}docker save folds the image into one file, about 176 megabytes.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:08.69,0:01:12.64,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,上传那一步把它送进 artifact 存储，保留一天\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}The upload step carries it to the artifact store, kept for one day.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:12.96,0:01:14.88,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,然后构建用的机器就被扔掉了\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}Then the build machine is thrown away.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:15.12,0:01:17.12,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,现在进到一个全新的检查 job 里\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}Now step into a fresh check job.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:17.44,0:01:20.92,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,一条额外的命令 docker images，只显示了表头\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}An extra command, docker images, shows just the header.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:21.24,0:01:22.68,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,一个 image 也没有\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}No image at all.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:22.73,0:01:26.48,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,所以每个检查 job 都要下载 artifact\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}So every check job downloads the artifact and runs
Dialogue: 0,0:01:26.48,0:01:28.43,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,再对这个 tar 跑 docker load -i\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}docker load -i on the tar:
Dialogue: 0,0:01:28.43,0:01:31.50,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,同一个 tag，从行李箱里拆出来\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}the same tag, unpacked from the suitcase.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:31.82,0:01:33.42,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,这就是 artifact 共享\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}That's artifact sharing.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:33.68,0:01:36.08,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,而且 artifact 一天后过期\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}And the artifact expires after a day,
Dialogue: 0,0:01:36.08,0:01:39.84,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,所以明天再重新运行一个失败的 job，会在下载那一步失败\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}so re-running a failed job tomorrow fails at the download.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:40.08,0:01:41.68,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,轮到你来预测\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}Your turn to predict.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:41.77,0:01:45.48,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,从 Unit Tests 这个 job 里删掉 Load Docker image 这一步\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}Delete the "Load Docker image" step from the unit tests job.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:45.80,0:01:48.04,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,哪一步会失败，报什么错？\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}Which step fails, and with what error?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:56.88,0:01:58.48,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,是 Run unit tests 这一步\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}The "Run unit tests" step.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:58.74,0:02:00.47,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,Docker 在这台机器上找 image\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}Docker looks for the image
Dialogue: 0,0:02:00.47,0:02:04.14,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,什么也没找到，再去问 Docker Hub\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}on the machine and finds nothing, then asks Docker Hub,
Dialogue: 0,0:02:04.14,0:02:07.27,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,那里也没有这个 image：pull access denied\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}where no such image exists: pull access denied.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:07.59,0:02:12.20,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,退出码 125：这个步骤失败，job 也就失败了\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}Exit code 125: the step fails, so the job fails.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:13.75,0:02:15.35,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,接下来是 lint and format\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}Next, lint and format.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:15.63,0:02:18.54,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,课上说的编码规范，在这里就是 Black\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}The lecture's coding standards are Black here,
Dialogue: 0,0:02:18.54,0:02:21.00,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,静态代码分析就是 Flake8\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}and its static code analysis is Flake8.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:21.32,0:02:26.57,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,还记得第 9 讲：格式化工具会改写你的代码；linter 只报告\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}Remember lecture 9: a formatter rewrites your code; a linter only reports.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:26.82,0:02:32.13,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,两个都在 image 里运行，查 api 目录，都是 120 列\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}Both run inside the image, on the api/ folder, at 120 columns.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:32.45,0:02:35.99,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,Black 这一步的 continue-on-error 写着 false：它会阻断\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}The Black step says continue-on-error, false: it blocks.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:36.31,0:02:38.16,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,Flake8 这一步写的是 true\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}The Flake8 step says true:
Dialogue: 0,0:02:38.16,0:02:41.71,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,它只提示，是一个永远不会让 job 失败的警告\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}it's advisory, a warning that never fails the job.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:41.95,0:02:43.55,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,一个步骤是怎么失败的？\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}How does a step fail?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:43.66,0:02:46.00,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,每条命令结束时都有一个退出码\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}Every command ends with an exit code.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:46.32,0:02:47.92,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,0 打开门禁\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}Zero opens the gate.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:48.14,0:02:52.85,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,其他任何值都会关上它，红色从步骤爬到 job，再爬到整个 run\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}Anything else shuts it, and the red climbs from the step to the job to the whole run.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:53.10,0:02:56.79,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,在 run 1 里，Black 这一步：would reformat utils.py\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}Run 1, the Black step: would reformat utils.py.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:57.11,0:02:58.99,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,1 file would be reformatted\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}1 file would be reformatted.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:59.31,0:03:01.55,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,退出码 1，门禁关上了\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}Exit code 1, so the gate shuts.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:01.78,0:03:03.94,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,步骤列表显示了接下来发生的事\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}The step list shows what happened next.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:04.26,0:03:05.66,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,Black，failure\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}Black, failure.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:05.71,0:03:07.28,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,Flake8，skipped\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}Flake8, skipped.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:07.33,0:03:11.83,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,失败步骤下面的步骤都不会运行，除非它们要求总是运行\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}The steps below a failed step don't run, unless they ask to run always.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:12.07,0:03:15.06,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,原因就是你在第 9 讲见过的那处乱糟糟的格式\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}The cause is the mess you met in lecture 9,
Dialogue: 0,0:03:15.06,0:03:17.50,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,它是故意留在 repo 里的\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}still in the repository on purpose:
Dialogue: 0,0:03:17.50,0:03:22.03,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,逗号后面少了一个空格，该空两行的地方空了三行\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}no space after the comma, and three blank lines where two belong.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:22.27,0:03:24.25,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,被跳过的 Flake8 本来会说什么？\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}What would the skipped Flake8 have said?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:24.57,0:03:27.86,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,一次额外运行在同样那几行上给出两个警告\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}An extra run shows two warnings on those same lines.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:28.18,0:03:32.02,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,但即使那样它也只是提示：决定 job 的只有 Black\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}But even then it's advisory: only Black decides the job.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:32.25,0:03:37.50,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,这就是全部规则：一个步骤失败，是因为它的命令以非 0 的值退出\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}So that's the whole rule: a step fails when its command exits with anything but zero.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:37.82,0:03:39.97,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,CI 只听这一样东西\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}It's the only thing CI listens to.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:41.52,0:03:42.94,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,现在看测试\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}Now the tests.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:42.99,0:03:49.05,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,课上那一个测试方框，在这里是三个并排的 job，各在不同的层级\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}The lecture's one test box is three jobs here, side by side, each at a different altitude.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:49.28,0:03:53.93,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,单元测试一次检查一个函数，不依赖外部\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}Unit tests check one function at a time, with no outside dependencies.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:54.25,0:03:57.37,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,日志里收集了 11 个测试，11 个都通过\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}The log collects 11 tests, and 11 pass.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:57.62,0:04:01.50,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,接着覆盖率那一步又跑了一遍，11 个又全部通过\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}Then the coverage step runs them again, and all 11 pass again.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:01.82,0:04:04.05,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,可是 pytest 碰到一个内部错误\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}But pytest hits an internal error:
Dialogue: 0,0:04:04.05,0:04:07.45,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,permission denied，写不进覆盖率目录\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}permission denied, writing into the coverage folder.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:07.77,0:04:09.15,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,退出码 3\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}Exit code 3.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:09.20,0:04:10.80,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,可这个 job 是绿的\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}Yet the job is green.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:10.99,0:04:14.85,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,这一步写着 continue-on-error，所以失败被旁路到一边\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}The step says continue-on-error, so the failure is shunted aside.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:15.17,0:04:18.58,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,然后标着 if always 的上传找不到文件\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}Then the upload, marked if: always(), finds no files;
Dialogue: 0,0:04:18.58,0:04:20.89,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,在 GitHub 上，会有一个黄色警告说明这一点\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}on GitHub, a yellow warning says so.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:21.13,0:04:26.87,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,README 有一个小缺口：它承诺有终端、XML 和 HTML 三种报告\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}The README has a small gap: it promises terminal, XML and HTML reports.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:27.19,0:04:30.33,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,Docker 以 root 身份建出缺失的覆盖率目录\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}Docker creates the missing coverage folder as root,
Dialogue: 0,0:04:30.33,0:04:33.46,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,而 container 的用户 app 写不进去\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}and the container's user, app, can't write into it.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:33.78,0:04:37.90,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,先把目录建成可写的；练习里有修复方法\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}Create the folder writable first; the exercises have the fix.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:38.15,0:04:41.65,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,集成测试用的是 FastAPI 的测试客户端\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}Integration tests use the FastAPI test client:
Dialogue: 0,0:04:41.65,0:04:45.38,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,应用在同一个 Python 进程里被调用\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}the app is called inside the same Python process.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:45.70,0:04:47.32,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,没有服务器，也没有 port\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}No server, no port.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:47.64,0:04:51.04,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,10 passed。系统测试要真家伙\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}10 passed. System tests need the real thing.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:51.36,0:04:54.22,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,一个 container 在后台启动服务器\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}One container starts the server in the background and publishes port 9000 on the runner.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:54.22,0:04:56.97,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,把 port 9000 发布到 runner 上\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}One container starts the server in the background and publishes port 9000 on the runner.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:57.29,0:05:02.18,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,一条额外的命令 docker ps 显示它正在运行，9000 已经映射好了\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}An extra command, docker ps, shows it running, with 9000 mapped.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:02.42,0:05:08.24,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,然后 job 等 10 秒，用 curl -f 去敲 localhost:9000 的门\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}Then the job waits 10 seconds, and curl -f knocks on localhost:9000.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:08.56,0:05:12.51,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,只有欢迎消息回来了，下一道门禁才会打开\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}Only when the welcome message comes back does the next gate open.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:12.75,0:05:16.50,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,第二个 container 用 --network host 跑测试\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}A second container runs the tests with --network host:
Dialogue: 0,0:05:16.50,0:05:21.28,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,它共用 runner 的网络，所以 localhost:9000 能连到服务器\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}it shares the runner's network, so localhost:9000 reaches the server.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:21.60,0:05:22.88,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,5 passed\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}5 passed.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:22.93,0:05:25.62,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,最后是两个标着 if always 的步骤\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}Two steps marked if: always() come last,
Dialogue: 0,0:05:25.62,0:05:27.12,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,就算前面失败也会运行\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}even after a failure:
Dialogue: 0,0:05:27.12,0:05:30.65,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,显示服务器日志，每个测试请求都会到达那里\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}show the server log, where every test request arrives,
Dialogue: 0,0:05:30.65,0:05:33.00,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,然后停掉并删除 container\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}then stop and remove the container.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:33.32,0:05:35.90,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,这就是 README 说的条件执行\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}That's the README's conditional execution.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:36.15,0:05:40.07,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,在第 9 讲，没有服务器时这些测试会悄悄跳过\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}In lecture 9, a missing server made these tests skip quietly.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:40.39,0:05:43.28,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,在这里，curl 这道门禁让它大声地失败\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}Here the curl gate makes it fail loudly instead.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:44.92,0:05:51.04,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,最后一个 job：汇总，课上说它收集结果，报告通过还是失败\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}Last job: the summary, which the lecture says collects the results and reports pass or fail.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:51.36,0:05:53.83,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,它的 needs 那一行写的是三个测试 job\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}Its needs line names the three test jobs.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:54.15,0:05:57.73,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,而 if always 让它就算其中一个失败了也照样运行\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}And if: always() lets it run even when one of them failed:
Dialogue: 0,0:05:57.73,0:06:00.26,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,它会运行，但运行不等于通过\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}it runs, which isn't the same as passing.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:00.50,0:06:02.92,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,它的脚本打印每个 job 的结果\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}Its script prints each job's result,
Dialogue: 0,0:06:02.92,0:06:06.28,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,把一个状态写进 GitHub output 留给后面的步骤\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}writes a status to $GITHUB_OUTPUT for later steps,
Dialogue: 0,0:06:06.28,0:06:09.31,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,并以 1 退出，只要有任何一个结果不是 success\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}and exits with 1 if any result isn't success.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:09.55,0:06:12.43,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,在 run 1 里，到来的是三个 success\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}In run 1, three success tokens arrive:
Dialogue: 0,0:06:12.43,0:06:14.39,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,unit、integration、system\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}unit, integration, system.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:14.71,0:06:16.20,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,All tests passed\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}All tests passed.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:16.25,0:06:18.08,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,开头那个谜题，现在有答案了\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}And here is the hook, answered.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:18.40,0:06:22.16,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,这个 lint 不在 needs 里，所以它的失败永远到不了汇总\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}Lint isn't in needs, so its failure never reaches the summary.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:22.48,0:06:23.76,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,这个 run 还是红的\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}The run is still red,
Dialogue: 0,0:06:23.76,0:06:26.62,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,因为任何一个失败的 job 都会让整个 run 变红\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}because any failed job turns the whole run red.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:26.87,0:06:30.95,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,README 说汇总检查所有测试 job 的结果\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}The README says the summary checks the results of all test jobs,
Dialogue: 0,0:06:30.95,0:06:34.08,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,字面上这没错：lint 不是测试 job\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}and that's literally true: lint isn't a test job.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:34.40,0:06:37.05,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,把 lint and format 加进 needs 和检查里\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}Add lint and format to needs and to the check
Dialogue: 0,0:06:37.05,0:06:38.60,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,如果你想让它算数的话\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}if you want it counted.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:38.65,0:06:40.25,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,现在来看课上那个 bug\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}Now the bug from class.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:40.46,0:06:41.96,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,在演示 commit 里\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}In the demo commit,
Dialogue: 0,0:06:41.96,0:06:46.14,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,距离函数取的是 2 乘 z 的平方根，而不是 z 的\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}the distance function takes the square root of 2 times z, instead of z.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:46.46,0:06:48.68,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,这次我们替你跑过了：你只看就行\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}We ran this one for you: just watch.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:48.92,0:06:50.52,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,先预测，再看 run\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}Predict before the run.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:50.67,0:06:54.02,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,现在哪些 job 会变红，Test Summary 又会说什么？\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}Which jobs turn red now, and what does Test Summary say?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:02.85,0:07:05.94,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,Integration：红，1 failed，9 passed\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}Integration: red, 1 failed and 9 passed.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:06.26,0:07:10.23,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,3 和 4 的距离回来的是大约 7，不是 5\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}The distance for 3 and 4 came back as about 7, not 5.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:10.47,0:07:12.89,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,System：红，2 failed，3 passed\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}System: red, 2 failed and 3 passed:
Dialogue: 0,0:07:12.89,0:07:18.51,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,又是 3 和 4，还有默认点 1 和 2，回来的结果也太大了\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}3 and 4 again, and the default point, 1 and 2, which came back too large as well.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:18.83,0:07:22.90,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,Unit：绿，因为只有 power 函数有单元测试\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}Unit: green, because only the power function has unit tests.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:23.22,0:07:26.00,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,Lint：照样红，因为 utils.py\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}Lint: red anyway, for utils.py.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:26.23,0:07:29.86,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,而汇总现在说有测试失败了，并以 1 退出\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}And the summary now says some tests failed, and exits with 1.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:30.18,0:07:31.89,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,这一次，汇总听见了\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}This time the summary heard it.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:33.43,0:07:35.69,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,回到 run 1，还有课上那个循环\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}Back to run 1 and the lecture's loop.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:36.01,0:07:41.44,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,通知回来是红的，所以现在开发者修代码\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}The notification came back red, so now the developer fixes the code and commits again,
Dialogue: 0,0:07:41.44,0:07:43.65,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,再 commit 一次，循环再转一圈\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}and the loop goes around once more.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:43.90,0:07:48.14,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,修复用的是第 9 讲的工具，同一个 README 的 Part 4\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}The fix is the tool from lecture 9, Part 4 of the same README,
Dialogue: 0,0:07:48.14,0:07:50.26,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,所以这些步骤在这里是额外的\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}so these steps are extras here.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:50.58,0:07:53.76,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,先 pip install pre-commit，再 pre-commit install\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}pip install pre-commit, then pre-commit install,
Dialogue: 0,0:07:53.76,0:07:56.15,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,它把 hook 放进 .git/hooks\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}which puts the hook into .git/hooks.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:56.38,0:07:58.54,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,然后跑 pre-commit run --all-files\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}Then pre-commit run --all-files.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:58.86,0:08:00.66,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,卫生检查都通过\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}The hygiene checks pass;
Dialogue: 0,0:08:00.66,0:08:05.30,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,Black 失败了，因为它改了一个文件：reformatted utils.py\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}Black fails, because it modified a file: reformatted utils.py.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:05.62,0:08:07.22,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,接着 Flake8 通过了\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}Flake8 then passes.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:07.52,0:08:08.87,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,暂停一下，自己跑一遍\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}Pause and run it.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:08.92,0:08:11.77,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,用 git diff 能看到 Black 到底改了什么\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}git diff shows exactly what Black changed:
Dialogue: 0,0:08:11.77,0:08:15.10,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,逗号后面加了空格，删掉了一个空行\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}a space after the comma, and one blank line gone.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:15.35,0:08:17.59,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,再跑一遍，所有 hook 都通过\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}Run it again, and every hook passes.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:17.91,0:08:19.53,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,没有要修的了\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}Nothing is left to fix.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:19.95,0:08:23.38,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,现在 git add .，再 git commit，写上信息\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}Now git add ., and git commit with a message:
Dialogue: 0,0:08:23.38,0:08:25.43,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,Format utils.py with Black\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}Format utils.py with Black.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:25.75,0:08:28.40,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,这条信息是我们写的；README 里没有\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}The message is ours; the README has none.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:28.72,0:08:30.91,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,这些 hook 在 commit 时运行，都通过了\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}The hooks run on the commit and pass.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:30.96,0:08:32.38,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,然后 git push\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}Then git push.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:32.43,0:08:34.03,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,暂停一下，push 你自己的\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}Pause and push yours.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:34.10,0:08:35.91,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,再看 run 2：六个全绿\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}Run 2: all six green.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:36.23,0:08:38.23,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,在 lint 这个 job 里，Black 满意了\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}In the lint job, Black is happy,
Dialogue: 0,0:08:38.23,0:08:40.84,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,这一次 Flake8 也跑了，而且通过了\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}and this time Flake8 runs too, and passes.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:41.16,0:08:44.08,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,在 fork 上，这是你的第一个 run，而且是绿的\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}On a fork, this is your first run, and it's green.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:44.33,0:08:47.04,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,现在你的 run 和 README 的截图一样了\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}Now your run matches the README's screenshot.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:47.36,0:08:50.77,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,循环转了一圈：一个红色的通知，一次修复\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}One turn of the loop: a red notification, a fix, a commit,
Dialogue: 0,0:08:50.77,0:08:52.37,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,一个 commit，一个绿色的 run\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}and a green run.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:53.78,0:08:56.54,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,课上把这个叫作本地难题\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}The lecture calls this one the local conundrum.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:56.86,0:08:59.18,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,如果 hook 已经在你的笔记本上跑过了\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}If the hooks already ran on your laptop,
Dialogue: 0,0:08:59.18,0:09:01.61,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,为什么还要在服务器上再跑一遍同样的检查？\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}why run the same checks again on a server?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:01.85,0:09:04.65,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,这些步骤都是额外的，你只看就行\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}These steps are extras, and you can just watch.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:04.97,0:09:09.18,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,快速改一下，把 service.py 里一行的空格挤掉\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}A quick edit squeezes the spaces out of one line in service.py,
Dialogue: 0,0:09:09.18,0:09:10.78,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,git diff 能看到\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}and git diff shows it.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:10.92,0:09:14.12,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,先 git add .，再 git commit -m "quick fix"\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}git add ., then git commit -m "quick fix".
Dialogue: 0,0:09:14.44,0:09:16.96,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,Black 这个 hook 失败了，并重新格式化了文件\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}The Black hook fails and reformats the file,
Dialogue: 0,0:09:16.96,0:09:18.75,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,所以 hook 拦下了这次 commit\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}so the hook stopped the commit.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:19.68,0:09:23.57,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,用 git status --short 看，显示两个字母 M，表示已修改\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}git status --short shows the letter M, for modified, twice.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:23.89,0:09:28.24,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,Black 修好了你工作区里的文件，但暂存的那份还是乱的\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}Black fixed your working copy, but the staged copy is still the messy one.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:28.48,0:09:30.41,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,现在是课上那条命令\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}Now the lecture's command:
Dialogue: 0,0:09:30.41,0:09:33.22,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,git commit --no-verify -m "quick fix"\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}git commit --no-verify -m "quick fix".
Dialogue: 0,0:09:33.54,0:09:35.86,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,没有任何 hook 运行，commit 也生成了\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}No hook ran, and the commit exists:
Dialogue: 0,0:09:35.86,0:09:38.57,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,--no-verify 跳过了所有 pre-commit 检查\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}--no-verify skips every pre-commit check.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:38.85,0:09:40.06,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,我们把它 push 上去\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}We push it.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:40.11,0:09:43.59,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,再看 run 3：lint and format 红了，因为 service.py\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}Run 3: lint and format, red, on service.py.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:43.91,0:09:46.02,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,测试和汇总全都通过\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}The tests and the summary all pass.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:46.68,0:09:49.90,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,被跳过的 Flake8 本来会把那一行标出三次\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}The skipped Flake8 would have flagged that line three times.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:50.22,0:09:53.11,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,被 --no-verify 放过去的，CI 抓住了\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}CI caught what --no-verify let through:
Dialogue: 0,0:09:53.11,0:09:55.11,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,课件第 31 页，就在你的终端里\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}slide 31, at your terminal.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:55.35,0:09:56.95,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,收拾一下这个实验\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}Clean up the experiment.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:57.16,0:10:01.45,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,在这里，git restore 只是扔掉了工作区里 Black 的修复\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}Here, git restore only throws away Black's fix in the working copy.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:01.77,0:10:05.35,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,如果你跟着做了，那个乱的 commit 现在就在你的 main 上\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}If you followed along, the messy commit is on your main now,
Dialogue: 0,0:10:05.35,0:10:07.79,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,不管 push 了没有。还没 push？\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}pushed or not. Not pushed yet?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:08.11,0:10:12.14,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,用 git reset --hard HEAD~1 把它去掉。已经 push 了？\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}git reset --hard HEAD~1 drops it. Pushed?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:12.40,0:10:16.53,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,先跑 pre-commit run --all-files，再 add、commit、push\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}Run pre-commit run --all-files, then add, commit and push,
Dialogue: 0,0:10:16.53,0:10:17.85,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,然后再做 Part 6\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}before part 6.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:17.90,0:10:22.89,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,但 CI 只重复 Black 和 Flake8，而且只查 api 目录\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}But CI repeats only Black and Flake8, and only on the api/ folder.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:23.21,0:10:26.27,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,七个卫生检查 hook 在 CI 里从来不跑\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}The seven hygiene hooks never run in CI:
Dialogue: 0,0:10:26.27,0:10:33.24,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,行尾空白、文件结尾、YAML、大文件、JSON、合并冲突标记和私钥\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}trailing whitespace, end of file, YAML, large files, JSON, merge markers, and private keys.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:33.48,0:10:37.41,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,还有一个缺口：hook pin 住的 Black 比 image 里装的旧\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}One more gap: the hooks pin an older Black than the image installs.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:37.73,0:10:41.48,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,录制时它们是一致的，但可能会慢慢分开\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}At the time of recording they agreed, but they can drift apart.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:41.73,0:10:45.03,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,一个队友用 --no-verify commit 了一个私钥文件\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}A teammate commits a private key file with --no-verify
Dialogue: 0,0:10:45.03,0:10:46.59,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,还 push 到了 main\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}and pushes to main.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:46.64,0:10:48.86,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,这条 pipeline 里哪个 job 能抓住它？\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}Which job of this pipeline catches it?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:57.70,0:11:01.54,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,一个也没有。这个 detect-private-key 只是本地 hook\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}None. The detect-private-key hook is a local hook only.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:01.86,0:11:05.49,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,解决办法是加一个 CI 步骤，pre-commit run --all-files\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}The fix is one CI step, pre-commit run --all-files:
Dialogue: 0,0:11:05.49,0:11:10.12,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,正是课上设想的那条 Slack 消息里失败的那一步\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}the very step that fails on the lecture's imagined Slack message.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:10.44,0:11:13.19,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,还要轮换那个密钥；它已经在 GitHub 上了\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}And rotate that key; it's already on GitHub.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:14.53,0:11:18.27,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,那条设想中的消息，把我们带回课上的 webhook\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}That imagined message brings us back to the lecture's webhooks.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:18.59,0:11:21.91,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,所谓 webhook，就是 GitHub 去调用一个外部地址\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}A webhook is GitHub calling an outside address
Dialogue: 0,0:11:21.91,0:11:26.96,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,在发生某件事的时候：用来启动像 Jenkins 这样的外部 CI 系统\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}when something happens: to start an outside CI system such as Jenkins,
Dialogue: 0,0:11:26.96,0:11:29.27,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,用来部署，或者往聊天工具里发消息\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}to deploy, or to post to a chat.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:29.52,0:11:33.06,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,这部分是可选的：需要你自己的 Slack 工作区\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}This part is optional: it needs your own Slack workspace.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:33.38,0:11:35.81,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,而这个 webhook 的方向是反过来的\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}And this webhook works the other way round.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:36.13,0:11:39.07,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,Slack 给你一个 incoming webhook，也就是一个地址\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}Slack gives you an incoming webhook, an address,
Dialogue: 0,0:11:39.07,0:11:42.19,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,Test Summary 这个 job 的最后几步去调用它\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}and the last steps of the test summary job call it.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:42.51,0:11:45.39,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,GitHub 不打这个铃；打铃的是你的工作流\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}GitHub doesn't ring this bell; your workflow does.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:45.63,0:11:50.81,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,课上设想的是一个 Slack 频道，每次 push 都会收到通知\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}The lecture imagines a Slack channel told about every push, failures included,
Dialogue: 0,0:11:50.81,0:11:53.59,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,失败也包括在内，还附上失败的步骤、数量和耗时\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}with the failed step, counts and duration.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:53.91,0:11:57.94,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,这个工作流发的少一些：通过还是失败、repo、分支、commit\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}This workflow sends less: passed or failed, the repository,
Dialogue: 0,0:11:57.94,0:12:02.32,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,和作者、每个测试 job 一个标记，还有两个链接\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}branch, commit and author, one mark per test job, and two links.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:02.55,0:12:04.53,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,这个 webhook 地址是一个 secret\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}The webhook address is a secret.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:04.85,0:12:08.91,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,在 Settings，Secrets and variables，Actions 下面\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}Add it under Settings → Secrets and variables → Actions,
Dialogue: 0,0:12:08.91,0:12:12.57,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,加一个名叫 Slack webhook URL 的新仓库 secret\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}as a new repository secret named SLACK_WEBHOOK_URL,
Dialogue: 0,0:12:12.57,0:12:14.17,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,别加在 Webhooks 页面里\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}not under Webhooks.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:14.39,0:12:18.19,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,它永远不进 repo，日志里显示成三个星号\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}It never goes in the repository, logs show it as ***,
Dialogue: 0,0:12:18.19,0:12:21.20,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,来自 fork 的 PR 拿不到它\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}and pull requests from forks don't get it.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:21.43,0:12:24.14,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,检查那一步看有没有设这个 secret\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}The check step tests whether the secret is set,
Dialogue: 0,0:12:24.14,0:12:26.51,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,然后写下 enabled 为 true 或 false\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}and writes enabled=true or enabled=false.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:26.83,0:12:29.31,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,为什么不直接在 if 那一行里测这个 secret？\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}Why not test the secret right in the if line?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:29.63,0:12:31.81,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,GitHub 不允许在那里用 secret\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}GitHub doesn't allow secrets there;
Dialogue: 0,0:12:31.81,0:12:36.62,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,这个 repo 自己的历史里就试过，后来换成了这个 shell 检查\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}the repository's own history tried it, and replaced it with this shell check.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:36.87,0:12:39.95,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,在 run 1 里没有 secret，所以 enabled 为 false\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}In run 1 there's no secret, so enabled is false,
Dialogue: 0,0:12:39.95,0:12:42.97,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,Slack 那一步被跳过，本该如此\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}and the Slack step is skipped, as it should be.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:43.22,0:12:44.77,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,再看演示 commit 那次 run\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}Now the demo run.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:44.82,0:12:46.52,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,Check test results 失败了\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}Check test results fails.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:46.84,0:12:50.28,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,检查那一步没有 if always，所以它也被跳过\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}The check step has no if: always(), so it's skipped too,
Dialogue: 0,0:12:50.28,0:12:54.03,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,enabled 一直是空的，Slack 那一步的条件就是 false\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}enabled stays empty, and the Slack step's condition is false.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:54.27,0:12:57.00,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,照现在这样写，这只铃只在有好消息时才响\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}As written, the bell only rings for good news.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:57.32,0:13:00.50,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,修复只要一行：在检查那一步加上 if always\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}The fix is one line: if: always(), on the check step.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:00.82,0:13:03.35,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,练习里有一个加固版\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}The exercises have a hardened version.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:04.70,0:13:08.48,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,README 的 Part 6 是可选的，它就是课上说的门禁\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}Part 6 of the README is optional, and it's the lecture's gate.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:08.80,0:13:11.53,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,由 push 触发的 run，就是 post-receive 这只铃\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}A push-triggered run is the post-receive bell.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:11.85,0:13:16.05,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,在 GitHub.com 上，会拒绝的那道门禁是分支保护\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}On GitHub.com, the gate that refuses is branch protection,
Dialogue: 0,0:13:16.05,0:13:18.08,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,加上必需的状态检查\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}with required status checks.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:18.32,0:13:21.43,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,打开 Settings 里的 Branches，给 main 加一条规则\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}Go to Settings → Branches, and add a rule for main.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:21.75,0:13:24.90,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,勾上这两项：Require a pull request before merging\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}Tick the boxes "Require a pull request before merging",
Dialogue: 0,0:13:24.90,0:13:27.87,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,还有 Require status checks to pass before merging\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}and "Require status checks to pass before merging".
Dialogue: 0,0:13:27.92,0:13:32.03,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,现在的页面可能叫它 classic 规则，或者改成提供 rulesets\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}Today's page may call it a classic rule, or offer rulesets instead.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:32.28,0:13:33.85,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,然后选出要用的检查\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}Then pick the checks.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:33.90,0:13:37.52,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,有一个小疏漏：选择列表按名字列出 job\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}A small slip: the picker lists jobs by their names,
Dialogue: 0,0:13:37.52,0:13:40.49,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,比如 Lint and Format Check 和 Unit Tests\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}like Lint and Format Check and Unit Tests,
Dialogue: 0,0:13:40.49,0:13:42.09,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,而不是 README 里的 ID\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}not the README's IDs.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:42.31,0:13:44.51,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,它们要在最近跑过一次 run 之后才会出现\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}They appear only after a recent run.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:44.83,0:13:48.03,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,在私有 repo 上，这需要付费套餐\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}On a private repository this needs a paid plan.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:48.27,0:13:52.34,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,然后测试一下：git checkout -b feature/test-protection\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}Then test it: git checkout -b feature/test-protection.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:52.66,0:13:56.45,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,单单 push 这个分支，什么也不会启动，触发条件那里你看到过\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}Pushing that branch starts nothing, as you saw with the triggers;
Dialogue: 0,0:13:56.45,0:13:59.13,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,run 在你打开 PR 时才开始\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}the run starts when you open the pull request.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:59.37,0:14:03.36,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,README 通过追加 def broken，assert False 来弄坏测试\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}The README breaks the tests by appending def broken(): assert False.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:03.68,0:14:06.88,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,在 image 里额外跑一次，结果还是 11 passed\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}An extra run in the image still says 11 passed,
Dialogue: 0,0:14:06.88,0:14:11.44,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,因为 pytest 只收集名字以 test 开头的函数\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}because pytest only collects functions whose names start with test.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:11.68,0:14:14.82,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,所以改名叫 test 下划线 broken，这是一个额外的修复\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}So name it test_broken instead, an extra fix.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:15.14,0:14:17.17,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,现在是 1 failed，11 passed\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}Now 1 failed and 11 passed.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:17.49,0:14:21.61,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,就是它让 PR 变红；开着保护\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}That's the one that turns the pull request red, and with protection on,
Dialogue: 0,0:14:21.61,0:14:23.35,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,合并按钮就一直锁着\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}the merge button stays locked.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:23.60,0:14:25.10,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,然后 git add .\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}Then git add .,
Dialogue: 0,0:14:25.10,0:14:27.69,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,git commit -m "Intentionally break tests"\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}git commit -m "Intentionally break tests",
Dialogue: 0,0:14:27.69,0:14:30.85,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,再 git push origin feature/test-protection\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}and git push origin feature/test-protection.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:31.17,0:14:36.12,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,在 GitHub 上打开 PR：测试通过之前，合并一直是锁着的\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}Open the pull request on GitHub: the merge stays locked until the tests pass.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:36.44,0:14:38.48,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,暂停一下，在你自己的 repo 上试一试\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}Pause and try it on yours.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:38.53,0:14:41.09,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,在这里，用 git checkout -- 把测试文件还原\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}Here, git checkout -- puts the test file back.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:42.23,0:14:48.42,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,课上许诺的转折：不确定性会进入每一个阶段，只要代码要训练模型\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}The twist the lecture promised: non-determinism enters every stage when the code trains a model.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:48.74,0:14:50.97,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,课上的答案是：一切都做版本管理\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}Its answers: version everything;
Dialogue: 0,0:14:50.97,0:14:55.15,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,自动化重新训练和测试，Milestone 5 就要求这个\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}automate retraining and testing, which Milestone 5 asks for;
Dialogue: 0,0:14:55.15,0:14:57.38,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,监控；还有谨慎上线\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}monitor; and roll out with care.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:57.62,0:15:03.87,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,持续部署是课上最后一节，它把发布自动化：那是第 23 讲\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}Continuous deployment, the lecture's last section, automates the release: that's lecture 23.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:04.12,0:15:08.10,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,收尾清理：切回 main，删掉 feature/test-protection 分支\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}Clean up: switch to main, and delete the feature/test-protection branch here
Dialogue: 0,0:15:08.10,0:15:09.60,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,这里和 GitHub 上都要删\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}and on GitHub;
Dialogue: 0,0:15:09.60,0:15:11.39,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,这样它的 PR 也就关闭了\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}that closes its pull request.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:11.71,0:15:13.02,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,把分支规则删掉\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}Remove the branch rule,
Dialogue: 0,0:15:13.02,0:15:15.91,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,还有 Slack 的 secret 和 webhook，如果你建了的话\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}and the Slack secret and webhook, if you made them.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:16.23,0:15:19.08,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,在私有 repo 上就停用这个工作流\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}Disable the workflow on a private repository,
Dialogue: 0,0:15:19.08,0:15:21.74,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,再跑一遍第 9 讲的 Docker 清理\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}and run the Docker cleanup from lecture 9.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:21.98,0:15:23.51,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,再看一遍循环\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}Once more, the loop.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:23.56,0:15:25.16,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,你的 push 就是事件\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}Your push is the event.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:25.35,0:15:27.33,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,每个 job 都有一台全新的机器\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}Each job gets a fresh machine,
Dialogue: 0,0:15:27.33,0:15:29.71,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,所以 image 要作为 artifact 来传\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}so the image travels as an artifact.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:30.03,0:15:32.97,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,每个步骤都是一道门禁，读的是退出码\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}Every step is a gate that reads an exit code,
Dialogue: 0,0:15:32.97,0:15:35.91,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,而汇总只听它 needs 里的 job\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}and the summary hears only the jobs it needs.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:36.15,0:15:38.09,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,自测一下，每道题都暂停想一想\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}Test yourself, pausing on each.
